# ── 换行符：仓库索引与工作区统一 LF，不受 core.autocrlf 影响 ──
* text=auto eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# ── Unreal 二进制资产（不做任何文本转换，也不做 diff）──
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.ubulk binary
*.uexp binary
*.uptnl binary
*.udic binary
*.upk binary
*.pak binary
*.sav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.fbx binary
*.tga binary
